24. Compliance

A MOS implementation complies with RFC-0006 if:

Intent is represented as a first-class Cognitive Element.
Decisions are separate from facts.
Decisions preserve uncertainty.
Actions originate from Intent.
Decisions remain explainable.
Delegation preserves provenance.
Evaluation feeds future learning.
